{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RiseInBorderland, a competitive multiplayer game. Players gather in a lobby before facing off in a series of intense games, each based on a playing card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spades:</strong> physical challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clubs:</strong> team-based trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diamonds:</strong> games of intelligence and logic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearts:</strong> games of trust\u2026 and betrayal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card has a number representing its difficulty. Win matches, collect the cards, and try to unlock the ultimate challenge: the Joker\u2019s Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond progression, earn rewards and virtual currency to customize your character and show off your unique style in the arena.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024930?t=1758723320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024930/8c4271346f1d742aaaf2392924a69005d4e24fbb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758723320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024930/1d0dbad8b11e0a3565827537fc19e972a42c46ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758723320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024930/1d0dbad8b11e0a3565827537fc19e972a42c46ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758723320","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":